.at/en/destinations/walking-holidays-malta/malta-gozo-8-days","https://www.sloways.eu/holidays-tours/malta-gozo-coastal-trail","https://www.s-capetravel.eu/holidays/malta-gozo-coastal-walking","https://www.thenaturaladventure.com/tours/malta/walking-in-malta-and-gozo/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Gozo day trip","type":"experience","detail":"A 25 minute ferry reaches Gozo for the Wied il-Ghasri inlet, red sand at Ramla and south coast paths past old watchtowers.","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":35,"urls":["https://www.destinationdaydreamer.com/unique-swimming-spots-in-malta-gozo/","https://www.hfholidays.co.uk/holidays-and-tours/walking-in-malta-and-gozo","https://www.celtictrailswalkingholidays.co.uk/walking-holidays/malta-and-gozo-coastal-trail/","https://wildrovertravel.com/tours/malta-and-gozo-hiking/","https://www.rambleworldwide.co.uk/inspiration/journey-through-malta-and-gozo-hiking-the-islands-hidden-gems"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"St John's Co-Cathedral","type":"experience","detail":"Behind a plain front lies a gilded Baroque interior and Caravaggio's Beheading of Saint John, the only work he signed.","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":35,"urls":["https://www.lonelyplanet.com/articles/top-things-to-do-in-valletta","https://www.qantas.com/travelinsider/en/explore/europe/malta/things-to-do-valletta.html","https://www.heatheronhertravels.com/things-to-do-in-valletta-malta/","https://www.packthesuitcases.com/things-to-do-in-valletta-malta/","https://www.weseektravel.com/things-to-do-valletta-malta/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Village festa season","type":"festival","detail":"Over 80 parish feasts with band marches and fireworks, UNESCO listed; seven villages celebrate Santa Marija on 15 August.","season":[4,5,6,7,8,9,10],"link":"https://www.maltalingua.com/malta/events/","evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":35,"urls":["https://www.maltalingua.com/malta/events/","https://rozie.app/village-festas-malta-2026-your-complete-